-- (§1.100) for client users with a phone set up to sign (§1.116). The browser shows a two-digit
-- number; the phone picks it and signs with its key behind Face ID or a fingerprint. Per person,
-- not per client, like `user_factor`. A new table only, so the previous Worker keeps working.
